# secrets
.env
**/.env
# ...and anything derived from them. A vim swap file of studio/.env was committed once (2026-09-25) and caught
# only by GitHub's push protection: `.env` matches the file, not the editor's sidecar.
.env.*
**/.env.*
*.swp
*.swo
*~

